using CTI's provisional constants. M/N reuse CTI's gated-before-inverse chunk math
with identity initialization and zero V, without upstream T precompute. Segment
zero's initial state is copied to workspace so final pool writes never alias an
initial-state read in the same launch. Fixup uses FP32 IEEE SIMT arithmetic.

